{"id":"5961","groups":[{"type":"pnri","label":"相关图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/5961_main_cumulus-congestus-stratocumulogenitus_clouds.JPG","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc1\"><p>图中，云显示出<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">平滑、水平及共同的云底</span>，有些云块阴暗，它更像是层积云。然而，透过云的间隙可清晰看到呈<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">活跃对流塔状</span>的积状云团。仔细观察塔顶发现有两个地方（<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">3</span>和<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">4</span>）呈花椰菜状。这表明这些云塔正在变为浓积云（通过探测证实），但也表明它们最有可能是从层积云发展而成，可指定为层积云性。在照片拍摄前，附近还出现了阵雨。附近的云幂仪测得的云底高度为1300米。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Jarmo Koistinen","location":"芬兰，埃斯波","latitude":"纬度: 60° 12' 12'' N","longitude":"经度: 24° 38' 39'' E","date":"14 August 2008 1801 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向北","cloudCode":"CL= 2, CM= 0, CH= 0","code":"图像P/S代码: P.9.15","imageId":"图像P/S代码: P.9.15"},{"src":"/images/original/syn/5961_syn_cumulus-congestus-stratocumulogenitus_clouds.gif","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc2\"><p>天气图显示出以芬兰北部为中心的984 hPa深低压（季节性），和向挪威西南部延伸的低压槽。图片位置处于低压南侧变性极地海洋气团的中等西南气流中。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© 德国气象局","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""},{"src":"/images/compressed/upper/5961_upper_cumulus-congestus-stratocumulogenitus_clouds.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc3\"><p>1200 UTC在芬兰约基奥伊宁（WMO 02963）对同一气团进行了探测，结果显示出在不稳定大气中的充分混合的边界层，CAPE值相对高，为855 J/kg。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© 怀俄明大学","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""}]}]}